# Keep internal design documentation out of the deploy.
# .superdesign/ is tracked in git on purpose (it is the design system source of
# truth), but it is written for the team and tooling, not for visitors. Without
# this, Vercel serves it at /.superdesign/*.md as crawlable text/markdown.
.superdesign/

# SEO-AI-PLAYBOOK.md is internal strategy — tracked in git, never served.
# Same reasoning as .superdesign/ above. Listed ahead of the file landing so
# there is no window in which it could be deployed.
SEO-AI-PLAYBOOK.md

# .github/ holds the IndexNow workflow and its script. They are CI tooling
# that runs on GitHub Actions, not site content, so they are never deployed.
.github/

# Agent and design-tool configuration. Tracked for the tooling, never site
# content; without these lines Vercel serves them as public files.
.claude/
.codex/
.impeccable/
